   deleting its formula. Imported by pillar/top.sls, pillar/homepage.sls and
   pillar/GLOBAL.sls; GLOBAL exports them as pillar `features:<name>`, which
   salt/top.sls reads (the state top can't import from the pillar tree).

   wazuh: manager VM (formulas/wazuh, minion `wazuh`, .27) + wazuh-agent on
   every minion except cloud-edge (salt/top.sls) + its route/homepage tile.
   Off 2026-11-11 (8 GB on pve01), back on 2026-11-26 after pve01 got 32 GB
   (VM rebuilt, README "Bootstrap"). To turn it off: False here, comment the
   VM out in IaC-opentofu vms.tf (+ firewall.tf); turning it off does not
   uninstall the agents — see formulas/wazuh-agent/README.md "Disabled". #}
